From: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 5 May 2026 11:26:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 654/913] plat-stm32mp2: add a function to enable monitoring in
 PWR

Add a new function to enable monitoring in PWR for internal TAMPER
for STM32MP25 SoC:
- 1, 2 : the voltage and temperature monitoring with the MONEN bit of
         PWR_CR2 register
- 7 : VDDCORE monitoring under/over voltage, enabled by setting VCOREMONEN
      in the PWR control register 5 (PWR_CR5)
- 12: VDDCPU (Cortex A35) monitoring under/over voltage, enabled
      by setting VCPUMONEN in the PWR control register 6 (PWR_CR6)

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 6ef15945078865afa7d5a8dc3c50d09ba3d8f2c0 plat-stm32mp2: add a function to enable monitoring in PWR
c40385be7ca2c8eaf9733844f8dc1cc0b288ceb4 plat-stm32mp2: add a function to enable monitoring in PWR]
